  "title": "Hazelnut-Crusted Chinese Coconut Stir-Fry",
  "description": "A snappy, adventurous Chinese dish featuring dry sherry, coconut cream, and a crunchy hazelnut crust. Fodmap-friendly and perfect for a weeknight dinner.",
