  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "Heat the coconut oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the ginger paste and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the snow peas and red bell pepper, and cook for 3 minutes, until tender.",
    "In a small bowl, mix together the hazelnuts and brown sugar.",
    "Add the soy sauce and dry sherry to the skillet, and cook for 1 minute, until the sauce thickens.",
    "Add the coconut cream to the skillet, and cook for 1 minute, until heated through.",
    "Sprinkle the hazelnut mixture over the top of the stir-fry, and cook for 1 minute, until crispy.",
    "Season with garlic and scallions to taste.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional hazelnuts if desired."
  ],
